## 13. Administration Console

| Route | Function |
|---|---|
| `/admin/dashboard` | Platform metrics: users, materials, ratings, pending queue depth. |
| `/admin/materials` | Approval queue — approve, or reject with a written reason shown back to the submitter. |
| `/admin/materials/new`, `/admin/materials/$id/edit` | Direct authoring and editing. |
| `/admin/subjects` | Subject catalogue management. |
| `/admin/authors` | Author profiles, affiliations, expertise. |
| `/admin/educators` | Approve educator applications, link accounts to author profiles. |
| `/admin/reports` | Student feedback, ratings distribution, CSV export. |

Access is enforced twice: `admin-guard.tsx` hides the UI, and every admin policy in the database calls `has_role(auth.uid(),'admin')`.

